{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-hostile-species","chapterId":"handbook-monster-4014016","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-hostile-species-handbook-monster-4014016-handbook-monster-4014016-0","text":"「纷争」的拱卫者，其疯狂已教那强韧的灵魂平息，它的主人从此屹立。\n如同战歌，如同北风，它的投矛从来利落：为敌人送去覆灭，为斗士送去淬炼，为挚友与救主送去光荣、敬意与决心。","speaker":""}]}
